<title>USA: EastGroup buy 2 properties for $4.1 mln.</title>
<headline>EastGroup buy 2 properties for $4.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>EastGroup Properties said on Monday that it has acquired two industrial properties in Jackson, Mississippi in separate transactions for a total price of $4,125,000.</p>
<p>Interchange A, which contains 33,000 square feet, was built in 1981 and is 86 percent leased.</p>
<p>Interchange D, which is 67,275 square feet, was constructed in 1989 and is 100 percent leased.</p>
</text>
